#: bl/operators.py:89
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Duplicate the selected mesh (raised 2 cm) as a receiver surface. Every face centre becomes a listening point, so subdivide the source mesh for resolution"
msgstr "将所选网格复制（抬高 2 厘米）为接收面。每个面中心都会成为听音点，因此请细分源网格以提高分辨率"

#: bl/volume.py:336
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Empty that controls the slice planes: planes near it are opaque and the others fade. Snap it to surfaces with Blender's snapping"
msgstr "控制切片平面的空物体：靠近它的平面不透明，其他平面淡出。使用 Blender 的吸附将其吸附到表面"

#: bl/volume.py:353
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Evaluate the selected map on a 3D grid inside the volume region"
msgstr "在体积区域内的 3D 网格上评估所选映射"

#: bl/report.py:255
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Export Report (PDF)"
msgstr "导出报告 (PDF)"

#: bl/auto.py:40
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Find the walkable, upward-facing surfaces of the selected meshes (or all visible meshes) and build a receiver from them. Steps and raked seating work because connected faces are grouped into islands before small details are discarded"
msgstr "查找所选网格（或所有可见网格）中可行走的朝上表面，并据此构建接收器。台阶和阶梯式座椅也可用，因为相连的面会先分组为孤岛，再舍弃细小细节"

#: bl/operators.py:135
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Free-field prediction on all receiver surfaces. Not validated"
msgstr "对所有接收面进行自由场预测。未验证"

#: bl/arrays.py:289
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Front-to-back levels on a horizontal ring around the array (phase-aware, this array alone)"
msgstr "阵列周围水平环上的前后向电平（考虑相位，仅此阵列）"

#: bl/operators.py:215
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Give the selected meshes the chosen library surface so they reflect sound"
msgstr "为所选网格指定选定的库表面，使其反射声音"

#: bl/auto.py:105
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Mark meshes so each face gets a surface from its Blender material name (glass, curtain, carpet, seat...) or, failing that, from its orientation (floor, ceiling, wall)"
msgstr "标记网格，使每个面根据其 Blender 材质名称（玻璃、窗帘、地毯、座椅……）获得表面，若无匹配则根据其朝向（地面、天花板、墙壁）"

#: bl/operators.py:253
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "New Speaker From Datasheet"
msgstr "从数据表新建扬声器"

#: bl/report.py:256
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "One readable PDF with the speakers and their angles, arrays, room acoustics, receiver and fog images, audio probes, surfaces and data sources"
msgstr "生成一份易读的 PDF，包含扬声器及其角度、阵列、房间声学、接收器与雾图、音频探针、表面和数据源"

