msgid "RT60 per octave band (Sabine and Eyring) from the surface-assigned meshes, plus air absorption. Volume is the override or the bounding box of the surfaces"
msgstr "根据已分配表面的网格计算各倍频程的 RT60（Sabine 与 Eyring），并计入空气吸收。体积取覆盖值或表面的包围盒"

