msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Suggest splay angles that aim the cabinets at evenly spaced points between the near and far audience distances. Geometric suggestion only"
msgstr "建议张开角度，使各箱体对准近场与远场观众距离之间等间距的点。仅为几何建议"

